 body=compact_hero('NDIS support FAQs for Canberra','Your questions','These NDIS support FAQs cover starting services and making arrangements with Barmil in Canberra. Find practical answers, then contact us with questions about your own circumstances.')+f'<section class="section white"><div class="container editorial"><h2>Starting support and making arrangements</h2><p>For questions about NDIS support in Canberra, begin with service areas, your goals and the arrangements you need. Availability and funding must be discussed for your situation.</p>{faq_html(GLOBAL_FAQS)}</div></section>'
