 body=compact_hero('Contact Barmil Care Services in Canberra','Let’s talk','Contact Barmil Care Services in Canberra with an NDIS support enquiry. Tell us about your routine, suburb and the assistance you need. You can contact us yourself or involve someone you trust.')+f'''<section class="section" style="padding-top:15px"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-panel"><h2>A conversation is<br>a good place to start.</h2><p class="muted">Choose the contact method that suits you.</p><div class="contact-method"><span>Call Barmil</span>{link('tel:'+B['phoneHref'],B['phone'])}<p>{B['hours']}</p></div><div class="contact-method"><span>Email us</span>{link('mailto:'+B['email'],B['email'])}</div><div class="contact-method"><span>Service area</span><p>Throughout Canberra, ACT.</p>{link('/service-areas','See service areas','text-link')}</div></div><div class="contact-panel primary"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#c4cdfb;margin-bottom:20px">Make an enquiry</div><h2>What would make<br>everyday life easier?</h2>{contact_online}</div></div></section><section class="section white"><div class="container editorial"><h2>A few details that help us respond</h2><p>When you contact Barmil Care Services, keep your first enquiry brief. A few practical details help us discuss the right next step.</p><ul class="checklist"><li>Your name and preferred way for us to contact you.</li><li>Your Canberra suburb and the service or task you need help with.</li><li>Your preferred days or times, if you have them.</li><li>Any access or communication preferences you want us to know about.</li></ul><p>Please avoid including sensitive health records or identity documents in your first enquiry. You can ask how to share further information if it is needed.</p></div></section>'''
