 body=compact_hero('Barmil Care Services privacy information','Your information','This Barmil Care Services privacy information explains the contact options for Canberra enquiries and how to ask about personal information you share.')+f'''<section class="section white"><div class="container editorial"><h2>Information you choose to provide</h2><p>When you contact Barmil by phone, email or the enquiry form, you may provide your name, contact details, suburb and information about the support you are looking for. These details help Barmil respond to your enquiry and discuss suitable next steps.</p><h2>Keep your first enquiry brief</h2><p>Please do not send identity documents, NDIS plan documents or detailed health records in an initial enquiry. Ask the team how to share any further information needed for arranging support.</p><h2>Website and contact services</h2><p>This website provides phone and email links. The online enquiry form, when enabled, securely sends details through Cloudflare Pages and Resend; Cloudflare Turnstile is used for spam prevention. Your email provider, the form service and the website hosting provider may process information needed to operate those services.</p><h2>Your questions and requests</h2><p>Contact Barmil with privacy questions about personal information, requests for access or correction, or a concern about how your enquiry is handled. Additional information about records and service arrangements can be discussed before support begins.</p><p>Email {link('mailto:'+B['email'],B['email'])} or call {link('tel:'+B['phoneHref'],B['phone'])}.</p></div></section>'''
